# Local-only secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored).
# In production these are set with:  npx wrangler secret put <NAME>

# ── Provider keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# One per provider profile. The name is KEY_ + the profile id, uppercased with
# non-alphanumerics replaced by "_". Set only the ones you actually use —
# providers without a key simply show as "bring your own key" in the app.
KEY_GROQ=
# KEY_OPENAI=
# KEY_ANTHROPIC=
# KEY_OPENROUTER=
# KEY_TOGETHER=
# KEY_CEREBRAS=

# ── Optional: shared access passcode ──────────────────────────────────────────
# When set, the app must send a matching passcode before the gateway will spend
# any server-held key. Leave unset for an open (unauthenticated) gateway.
# ACCESS_PASSCODE=

# ── Optional: per-profile base URL override ───────────────────────────────────
# BASE_URL_GROQ=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
